      "text": "The Metropolitan Manila Development Authority (MMDA) has released the top five traffic violations in 2025 as it reminded motorists that driving comes with a responsibility to obey traffic rules.\n\nAccording to a report on “24 Oras,” the MMDA Traffic Ticket Management Division said the leading traffic violation in 2025 is illegal turning.\n\nThis is followed by unattended illegal parking, disregarding traffic signs, disregarding the number coding scheme, and attended illegal parking.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/SDWQYQvl6S",
